// Cloudflare: the built app (dist) served by a small Worker from Workers KV (worker/site.js, docs/decisions.md,
// 2026-11-02). No server code yet: the Timely and scan-AI servers wait for sign-in on the server, as anyone with the link
// could reach them otherwise. Deploy: npm run deploy (Wrangler, with its usage statistics turned off).
{
  "name": "gobi-erp",
  "main": "worker/site.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "site": { "bucket": "./dist" }
}
